Actions :

a. . click()
Clicks an element.

await page.getByRole('button', {
  name: 'Login'
}).click();

b. . fill()
Used for text fields.

HTML:
<input type="text">

TypeScript:
await page
  .getByRole('textbox')
  .fill('Kirti');


c. check()
Used for checkboxes.

HTML:
<input type="checkbox">

TypeScript:
await page
  .getByRole('checkbox')
  .check();


d. . uncheck()
Untick a checkbox.

await page
  .getByRole('checkbox')
  .uncheck();


e. . selectOption()
Used for dropdowns.

HTML:
<select>
  <option value="india">India</option>
  <option value="usa">USA</option>
</select>

TypeScript:
await page
  .locator('select')
  .selectOption('india');

or
await page
  .locator('select')
  .selectOption({ label: 'India' });


f. . hover()

Move mouse over an element.

await page
  .getByText('Products')
  .hover();


g. . press()
Press a keyboard key.

await page
  .getByRole('textbox')
  .press('Enter');

Examples:

.press('Enter')
.press('Tab')
.press('Escape')
.press('ArrowDown')